                  "textContent": "Every page is prerendered at build time and served from a CDN, so static pages are HTML and CSS with no JavaScript at all. Fast everywhere. Costs pennies. Online forever. Add accounts or a database, pick a server adapter, and the same command also writes a self-contained Hono worker for Cloudflare, Node, or Bun."
                },
